  "reason": "The strongest completed result is config_002: RNA-only multiprofile with PCA and avgpool aggregation, which substantially outperforms RNA-only singleprofile and far exceeds image-only ResNet50. The key remaining uncertainty is whether transformer aggregation can improve on avgpool for the same multiprofile RNA representation. config_003 changes only aggregation from avgpool to transformer while keeping rna_only, multiprofile, and pca_n2000 fixed, so it cleanly isolates the aggregation effect. This is a high-value next experiment because it exploits the current best direction while reducing uncertainty about an important design choice before spending budget on more complex multimodal or new encoder variants."
